"category":"Diners","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Cocktail Bars","historical_business_count":2}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), Bars, Breakfast & Brunch, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":6},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"CG1Bb2MTraJYTHCPFm72XA","review_id":"NV0_AUlUSV059gCHwoSpFw","date":"2016-10-05T02:23:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9425104856491089,"text_excerpt":"Two visits to Red Dog Diner and I'm hooked. Both times I was here for brunch/lunch with girlfriends and both times we loved our food, drinks and service. On my first visit I had the duck waffle and the mac and cheese. Both were delicious. The duck waffle was a full meal for me and I had to take home most of the mac. Next I had the shrimp and grits...ugh YUM! My friend sampled my food and agreed. It was nice to sit at the bar. Before we ordered it was helpful to see what lots of different dishes looked like to get an idea of what we wanted. Service at the bar is generally better, no matter what restaurant I'm in. I'd especially recommend this place to bring your out-of-town guests. The men..."},{"business_id":"CG1Bb2MTraJYTHCPFm72XA","review_id":"X92vvCEFA8qiHeAGy18__Q","date":"2018-08-22T03:44:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9412801861763,"text_excerpt":"This place is seriously the best. It was open on St. Patrick's Day super late and that was my first time there. I love how it has typical diner food but it also has healthy options that appeal to me. I was really impressed with the hummus plate I got. The feta and red peppers were a great touch and the pita was perfectly cooked and amazing. It's a good place to chill and I would definitely go back for more appetizer plates. They have great specials too for happy hour that they post and switch up on a board outside."},{"business_id":"CG1Bb2MTraJYTHCPFm72XA","review_id":"8_VAgREZq_1bBI_okGABjw","date":"2018-02-04T20:25:30","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9380635619163513,"text_excerpt":"We went here for breakfast. Holy cow, the food here is incredible! We waited about 35 minutes for a table and there were about 6 of us. So we sat at the bar. When you first walk in, you think, this place is small. But later you find out there is more to it. The bar in the front of the house is curved and has beautifully crafted wood on it. There is a hallway that takes you to the back of the house which is just as unique and as pretty as the front of the house. I loved the back bar. You're basically in a covered outside, courtyard. Then you see the rest of the dining tables on top of a wooden deck style platform. So this is where we ate. I ordered a half liter of the Katrina drink which t..."}]